          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mudimu wawu wakatalaŋawu wowachimbariu, namesa, nenopu, nitumeŋa, nayuma yamalala yakalakala ŋawu nachu, niihina damuchisu, nimudimu wawu wejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakela mwanta wawatulamba twawaLevi yowu Eleyazari mwana kakapristu Aroni, diyi wakatalaŋa akwakutala mudimu wamalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AkwaMerari adiŋi nichisaka chawaMahali, nichisaka chawaMushi; diyi yisaka yawaMerari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achindiluwu mwachindila ŋawu amayala ejima, kutachikila hadi akakweji kamu niakubadikamu, ashikili mumakombakaji atanu nadimu, namakulakaji ayedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kalamba kevumu dawankakululaja yisaka yaMerari yowu Zuriyeli mwana kaAbihayili. Akate ekaŋa kumutambawatabanaka wakukabeta kakuchimtmswa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
