          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akate-ekaŋa kumesu atabanaka kumusela, kumesu etenti dakubulakena kwaselelaŋa itaŋwa, wowaMosi naAroni nawanyanindi, atalaŋa mudimu wamalala wakukoŋela anyana kaIsarela. Mwenyi wakadataku akamujahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ALevi achindiluwu ejima, achindiluwu kudi aMosi naAroni mwayilejeluwukudi Yehova, mwahita yisaka yawu, amayala ejima akutachikila hadiakakweji kamu niakubadikamu, ashikili mumakombakaji makumi ayedi namakombakaji ayedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
